# Orbit Shorts — Related video (locked 2026-08-27)

**Every Orbit Short** (live, scheduled, and past public) must have a YouTube Studio **Related video** set in **desktop Studio** (not mobile). That is the SEA-style play-pill under the handle. It is the **primary Short → long CTA**.

## Target

Related video = **that Short’s Thursday long only** (the film the Short already sells).

- Never another Short
- Never a dead id
- Never dump every Short onto one film

## Week map (locked)

| Window | Related long id |
|--------|-----------------|
| Last Star week + leftovers through **2 Sep** | `REXYxuLOBoI` (**letter O**, not zero) |
| Europa week **3–9 Sep** | `NbW5G1BpPY0` |
| Neutron week from **10 Sep** | `Yk1tLh23rko` |
| JWST leftovers **Sat 22–Tue 25** | `ziKBPJ6FY0U` |
| Live leftovers (Fermi · Black Hole · Alien Worlds, etc.) | the long that Short already names |

## Also locked

- **Zero `/go/`** on Shorts
- A **pin is NOT required** if Related video is set. Pins already live may stay
- Longs do **not** get this field
- Long thumbs stay **picture + short SEA-style hook** (no Orbit · no generic CTA)

## How (desktop Studio only)

Content → Short → **Related video** → pick the Thursday long → **Save**.

Requires **Advanced features** (the card exists on this channel). Not available (or not reliable) on mobile Studio. Data API cannot set Related — Studio finish only.

## Ship gate

Do **not** mark a Short funnel-complete, auditor-shipped, or Studio-finished until Related → that Short’s Thursday long is confirmed. See `orbit-shorts-punch-first.mdc` · `orbit-auditor-ship-gate.mdc` · `00_Brand/Channel-Setup/SHORTS_FUNNEL_AND_CROSSPOST.md`.
